COPY config."ConfigurationUpdate" ("Id", "Version", "Name", "Description", "CreatedAt", "InstalledAt") FROM stdin;
06ff9d01-0000-7015-8485-1d835e4ec7ad	58	Fix Damage Calculations	This update fixes character stats, skills, magic effects, items, and options related to damage. It also adds the Berserker magic effect.	2025-08-07 09:00:00-07	2026-05-06 13:42:15.838795-07
06ff9d01-0000-7048-8c41-7ad8cd342a90	36	Fix Duel Arena Safezone Map	Sets the safezone of duel arena to lorencia.	2024-10-28 11:00:00-07	2026-05-06 13:42:15.838166-07
06ff9d01-0000-707e-782b-7979e7bab628	48	Fix Item Options And Attack Speed	This update fixes some item options (damage, defense rate), weapons attack speed, third wings defense, and some AA weapon values.	2025-03-05 08:00:00-08	2026-05-06 13:42:15.838467-07
06ff9d01-0000-714b-b853-0b67921ec7d3	70	Remove Jewel Drop Level Gap	This update removes the existing drop level gap condition for jewels and similar items that should always drop.	2026-03-05 08:00:00-08	2026-05-06 13:42:15.839207-07
06ff9d01-0000-716d-adef-a66f7b30e8e0	11	Add quest item limits	This update adds limits to quest items, so that only one item can be picked up.	2023-05-04 13:00:00-07	2026-05-06 13:42:15.837095-07
06ff9d01-0000-71ce-53ea-f1d9dafbf3fe	26	Fix Warrior Morning Star	This update fixes the discriminators of some ancient items.	2024-08-25 10:00:00-07	2026-05-06 13:42:15.837871-07
06ff9d01-0000-7201-cde5-704afe937e14	37	Fix Attack Speed Calculation	Adds attributes and relations for attack speed. Adds effects for Ale and Potion of Soul.	2024-10-19 07:00:00-07	2026-05-06 13:42:15.838217-07
06ff9d01-0000-720c-6b7c-8cc540a52d07	75	Add Global Money Amount Rate Attribute	Moves the MoneyAmountRate attribute from character class base attributes to global base attributes.	2026-03-20 13:00:00-07	2026-05-06 13:42:15.839374-07
06ff9d01-0000-723d-fc71-b56fb780f271	52	Fix Char Stats and DL Force Wave Str skill	This update fixes several character stats values and DL Force Wave Strengthener master skill.	2025-03-24 09:00:00-07	2026-05-06 13:42:15.838568-07
06ff9d01-0000-724c-eeeb-b1e707405817	45	Fix Chaos Mixes Settings And Several Options	This update fixes the Chaos Weapon, First Wings, Dinorant, Item Level Upgrade, Second Wings, Third Wings, Cape, SD Potions, Guardian Option, and Secromicon crafting settings; Blue Fenrir (Protect) damage decrease option value; Wizard's Ring wizardry option; lvl 380 item guardian options for Summoner and Rage Fighter.	2024-12-10 08:00:00-08	2026-05-06 13:42:15.838419-07
06ff9d01-0000-7289-a543-0f6164b2afee	24	Fixed socket seed crafting	This update sets the right settings for the socket seed crafting.	2024-08-25 08:00:00-07	2026-05-06 13:42:15.837772-07
06ff9d01-0000-729c-e74b-dc25350d50f3	64	Fix Jewelery and Pets Damage Calculations	This update fixes jewelery items and pet options related to damage, and jewelery resistance values.	2025-09-30 09:00:00-07	2026-05-06 13:42:15.838985-07
06ff9d01-0000-72c4-495a-8b0daa75227f	20	Some added skills	This update adds the following skills: Wizardry Enhance, Increase Health, Increase Block, Ignore Defense.	2024-07-20 05:00:00-07	2026-05-06 13:42:15.837537-07
06ff9d01-0000-72d3-e856-32f48b4f95c4	27	Fix Drain Life Skill	Updates the attributes of the summoner's Drain Life skill to make it work properly.	2024-08-29 11:00:00-07	2026-05-06 13:42:15.837922-07
06ff9d01-0000-72db-87a4-cb5e14693a9a	76	Add Maximum Alliance Size Attribute (Season 6)	Adds the MaximumAllianceSize global base attribute with a default value of 5 to the Season 6 game configuration.	2026-04-03 11:00:00-07	2026-05-06 13:42:15.839423-07
06ff9d01-0000-73d6-397d-d6b928b5d6c6	10	Fix Warp Level Reduction	This plugin updates the LevelWarpRequirementReductionPercent for MG, DL, and RF.	2023-04-23 19:05:00-07	2026-05-06 13:42:15.837036-07
06ff9d01-0000-749e-4a16-77fef305d746	15	Adds infinity arrow skill with quest	This update adds the infinity arrow skill as quest reward for 'Gain Hero Status (Muse Elf)'.	2023-08-28 13:30:00-07	2026-05-06 13:42:15.837289-07
06ff9d01-0000-7521-ac7d-2710e5d236c8	19	Chain Lightning skill	This update sets the right settings for the chain lightning skill.	2024-07-15 11:00:00-07	2026-05-06 13:42:15.837488-07
